# Feature set

After the utilities are stable, implement the following features.

# Existing features to move from the SkyHanni fork

Move the custom SkyHanni additions where practical.

Anything too tightly coupled to SkyHanni internals may remain there.

## Rare-drop animation system

Features:

- custom center-screen animation
- optional vanilla Totem-style animation
- item icon
- item name
- estimated price
- configurable duration
- configurable scale
- rarity-coloured flash
- custom sounds
- pet-drop support
- trophy-fish support
- ignored locations
- ignored exact items
- ignored item categories
- clickable ignore action
- queued playback during unsafe contexts
- evidence capture option
- screenshot option
- notification history

## Daily playtime tracking

Track:

- daily SkyBlock time
- rolling average
- all-time maximum
- configurable history retention
- daily/weekly/monthly history
- account/profile separation

## Animated title-screen background

- custom animated nebula background
- configurable colour palette
- compatibility mode for other title-screen mods
- disable animation option
- reduced-motion support

## SkyBlock level colour customization

- configurable level colours
- nametag colours
- tab-list colours where safe
- scoreboard colours where supported
- preview data integration

## Raffle task tracker

Track anniversary raffle tasks and progress.

## Sea Lumies highlighting

- configurable highlight
- colour
- distance
- outline/beam options

## Forge display

- Forge slot status
- completion timers
- notification on completion

## Garden view-bobbing control

Contextual control of view bobbing while on the Garden.

## Enchantment parsing and colours

- improved parsing
- custom colouring
- better formatting
- compatibility with multiple enchant text formats

## Visual Words improvements

- more robust text replacement
- formatted component support
- better editing support
- safer matching

## Waypoint format compatibility

Import Skyblocker-compatible waypoints and potentially other common formats.

## Easter eggs and media

- custom sounds
- secret triggers
- images
- video/GIF-based jokes
- hidden entries
- secret achievements

